  m_text: "The rogue military\u2019s final assault has failed. Their armored commander lies defeated, and the road into the city is secure. Your towers held the line through every wave, giving civilians time to evacuate and allied forces time to regroup. For the first time in days, the guns fall silent. Today, this ground belongs to its people again."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0161d805a3764c089bef00bfe00793f5, type: 2}
